    <detaileddescription>
<para>Error and event logging routines.</para>
<para>The following macros definitions are supported:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>CUB_LOG</computeroutput>. Simple event messages are printed to <computeroutput>stdout</computeroutput>. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
